      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e IIUC, does this mean that instead of the full api surface jar, we use the jar corresponding to sdk_version of the java_api_library?\n\nCorrect. Instead of the individual module libraries \"extracting\" the stub files from the full api surface stub jar file, this change allows the stub files to be generated \u0026 compiled in the module level and aggregated later to form the full api surface stub jar file. `sdk_version` of the top level sdk library module will be respected and propagated to the java_api_library submodules, so that from-text stubs generated from the non-SDK java_sdk_library can depend on the android APIs.",
